; A, alive; D, death.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Correlation between tumor EBV positivity on ISH and the clinico-laboratory findings</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-23-30-i002"/></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Correlation between BM involvement and the clinicolaboratory findings</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-23-30-i003"/></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>